```js {something=something}
console.log    (    "hello world"    );
```

```js{something=something}
console.log    (    "hello world"    );
```

<!-- Prettier 2.1 -->
```js {something=something}
console.log("hello world");
```

```js{something=something}
console.log("hello world");
```

<!-- Prettier 2.2 -->
```js {something=something}
console.log("hello world");
```

```js{something=something}
console.log    (    "hello world"    );
```
